      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 2 months ago",
      "body": "Hi there - I run zootots - I sell loads of original funky stuff for babies and young kids age 0-5 years - clothes, toys, books, shoes, furnishings and gifts. We started the business this year after the birth of baby no.1 - we offer a great referral scheme so tell friends and you'll get gift vouchers to spend!\nWe're always on the look out for new suppliers, so get in touch if you've got something magical and funky to sell or let me know what other brands you think I should consider stocking!\nMany thanks",
